      "EN": "Yeah. Good for you, man, supporting the free stalkers! I never doubted you. Look, I want to thank you properly. I do not have anything with me now, but that's not a problem: go to my friend in the bar, his name is Bald. I'll tell him you helped us, and he'll thank you.",
